// Munchkin on all fours, for the skinned mesh: a long, low tabby loaf on
// tiny legs, its belly nearly on the floor. The body lies along z (+z is
// forward), the head sits on the front of the chest, each leg has its own
// bone. Same face and coats as model.ron, the head at 85%.
// The tail comes from gen_tail.py: change it there and paste the output
// back in (python3 gen_tail.py | python3 ../splice.py quad.ron).
